==Description==
'''Easter Egg Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 15 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bunz|450}} or {{Robux|160}}. The total cost was {{Bunz|3,320}} or {{Robux|1,075}}.

==Appearance==
'''Easter Egg Charm''' showcases a cracked easter egg with a duckling inside of it. The egg is placed in a giant pot. It plays a sound of an egg cracking.

The color of the '''Easter Egg Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is purple in its preview in the inventory.

